## ⚠️ CRITICAL: Never Run basedpyright Without Source Dir

- ❌ NEVER `basedpyright .` or `basedpyright` (no args) — hangs indefinitely in 30+ repo workspace
- ✅ ALWAYS `timeout 120 basedpyright <source_dir>/` — see `.cursor/rules/basedpyright-safety.mdc`

