## CI/CD: Always Use Quickmerge (Never Standalone Quality Gates)

```bash
bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "feat: description"                        # deps match main
bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "feat: description" --dep-branch "name"   # deps differ
```

See `.cursor/rules/always-use-quickmerge.mdc`

---

## Sub-Agent Rule Inheritance — FULL RULES REQUIRED

Sub-agents start with FRESH context — always-apply rules are NOT inherited. Reduced context makes them miss rules.

**MANDATORY when launching any sub-agent:**
1. Paste contents of `unified-trading-pm/cursor-configs/SUB_AGENT_MANDATORY_RULES.md` at TOP of prompt, OR
2. Include at TOP: "Before any action, read unified-trading-pm/cursor-configs/SUB_AGENT_MANDATORY_RULES.md and follow ALL rules strictly."

Never rely on reminders alone — sub-agents need the full rules set.
See `.cursor/rules/agents-follow-cursor-rules.mdc`

