## Workspace Groups: Use for Epic Work

Background agents don't work with 30+ repo workspace. Use themed groups (already in `~/.zshrc`):

```bash
cursor-data      # Data pipeline epic work
cursor-features  # Features engineering epic work
cursor-ml        # ML training/inference epic work
cursor-trading   # Trading/execution/risk epic work
cursor-libs      # Library refactor epic work
cursor-uis       # UI epic work
cursor-pipeline  # Cross-pipeline epic work
cursor-infra     # Infrastructure/quality gates epic work
```

Epic → Workspace mapping:
- data-io/market-data epics → `cursor-data`
- features-* epics → `cursor-features`
- ml-* epics → `cursor-ml`
- post-trade/strategy/exchange epics → `cursor-trading`
- unified-libraries/library-dependency epics → `cursor-libs`
- *-ui epics → `cursor-uis`
- batch-live-symmetry epic → `cursor-pipeline`
- quality-gates/infra epics → `cursor-infra`

See: `.cursor/workspace-configs/WORKSPACE-RECOMMENDATIONS.md`

